The Go rendering: a command that formats a value and registers a handler by its
method name with a router module, each through a local variable holding the
function; and that formats a value, looks a method up by name on the router's
current handler, and formats through a wrapper, each through a variable holding
a method expression; and that looks an unexported field up by name through a
variable holding two lookups, each written first in one of two variables.

